# GMS pays this out only against enemies under damage over time, freezing,
# stun, darkness or paralysis. Two of the five are kept on a monster here, and
# the I/L's ice is one of them -- so this collects on anything the book has
# frozen. GMS's 10+x% ladder is kept whole: 11% up to 20%.
#
# The condition is binary, as GMS's is: a monster is afflicted or it is not,
# and a second status over the first says nothing. What climbs with the pile is
# Freezing Crush's own pair.
name: "Storm Magic"
skill_order: 7
description:
  "Increases your Final Damage when attacking enemies that are Frozen."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_MAGE
max_level: 10
base { final_dmg_pct_when_afflicted: 0.11 }
per_level { final_dmg_pct_when_afflicted: 0.01 }
